# Overrides `.env` for `vitest` (mode "test") only -- `npm run dev` and the
# Playwright webServer it starts are unaffected and keep using `.env`'s real
# value. Unit/component tests stub `fetch` directly; they never make a real
# network call, but several assert the exact URL client.ts builds, which
# must match `api/client.ts`'s own hardcoded fallback so those assertions
# stay meaningful regardless of what the live dev backend's port happens to
# be on this machine.
VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8000
